# Data Hub module map

**Acceptance SSOT:** [Data-Hub-Acceptance-System](../../../docs/acceptance/Data-Hub-Acceptance-System.md) · [Product-Readiness](../../../docs/acceptance/Data-Hub-Product-Readiness-Matrix.md) · edition [`docs/editions/data-hub.yaml`](../../../docs/editions/data-hub.yaml)

| Module | Path | Role |
|--------|------|------|
| Auth | `apps/api/src/auth/` | Service-to-service auth |
| Ingest | `apps/api/src/ingest/` | Inbound data pipelines |
| Registry | `apps/api/src/registry/` | Reference/catalog registry (`fx`, `banks`, `companies`, `hs`, `geo`, `uom`, `currencies`, `tax-rates`, `chart-of-accounts`, `calendar`, `iban`) |
| Cache | `apps/api/src/cache/` | Cached lookups |
| Prisma | `apps/api/src/prisma/` | DB access (`referenceDb()` → `era_data_hub` only) |
| Reference policy | `GET/PATCH /registry/v1/admin/reference-policy` | Per-catalog external fetch + FX code lists |
| FX display codes | `GET /registry/v1/fx/display-codes` | Dashboard and CBAR-check codes |
| FX rates | `GET /registry/v1/fx/rates` | FINAL on the date. `fallback=previous` is dashboard-only. Convert stays date-strict. Ingest 09:30 Asia/Baku then every 30 min until today's FINAL |

**Schema:** `packages/database/prisma/schema.prisma` (includes ISO `Currency` catalog — distinct from `CbarOfficialRate` FX).

Cross-system catalog sync: `db:sync-from-finance` (includes currencies upsert by code). See `docs/adr/era-data-hub.md`.
